  "/cookie-policy": "<section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">RESULTMINT</div><h1>Cookie Policy.</h1><p>How cookies and similar technologies may be used on the ResultMint website.</p></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"grid two\"><div class=\"card\"><h3>Essential technologies</h3><p class=\"small\">Some browser storage or technical mechanisms may be required for navigation, security, preferences or basic site functionality.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Analytics</h3><p class=\"small\">Where analytics are enabled, they may help us understand aggregate traffic, page performance and user journeys without being used to sell personal information.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Third-party content</h3><p class=\"small\">Embedded or externally hosted content may use technologies controlled by its provider. Their use is governed by that provider's own policies.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Your controls</h3><p class=\"small\">You can restrict or delete cookies using your browser settings. Some site features may behave differently when optional storage is disabled.</p></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><h3>Contact</h3><p class=\"small\">Questions: <a href=\"mailto:hello@resultmint.in\">hello@resultmint.in</a>.</p><p class=\"small\">Last updated: 15 August 2026.</p></div></div></section>",
